STEP 2 COMPLETE.  NO COUNTEREXAMPLE.

  The topological tear is real and compulsory - proved, not conjectured -
  and the global wrapping is exactly monodromy around it.  That yields a
  free numerical filter on any candidate: chi(F^-1(S_F)) = 1 (mod d).

  But the pseudo-holomorphic instrument cannot be built.  A Keller map is
  a holomorphic symplectomorphism of (C^2, dx^dy), and for that form the
  pairing omega(v, J0 v) vanishes identically: complex lines are
  Lagrangian.  Taming fails as badly as it can fail.  That is a structural
  obstruction to the whole approach, and it is better to know it than to
  keep pushing on it.

